epiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-05-29T11:23:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T17:00:30Z","closed_at":"2026-07-15T17:00:29Z","assignee":{"login":"jrouwe","id":1621693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE2OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1621693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe","html_url":"https://github.com/jrouwe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Not reproducible in 4.3-stable because Jolt wasn't available in Godot yet\n- Reproducible in 4.4-dev7 (first version to introduce Jolt)\n- Reproducible in 4.4-stable\n- Reproducible in 4.6.3-stable\n- Reproducible in 4.7-beta1\n\nThis bug has been in the engine since Jolt was first introduced\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.3.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9649) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-14900KF (32 threads) - 31.79 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using the Jolt physics engine, the [intersect_shape](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_physicsdirectspacestate3d.html#class-physicsdirectspacestate3d-method-intersect-shape) function detects duplicate collisions when overlapping with a CollisionShape3D that uses a ConcavePolygonShape3D.\n\nDetecting collisions is the most basic functionality of a physics engine, and this should be fixed as soon as possible.\n\nBecause of this bug, not only does intersect_shape detect duplicate collisions, but it also discards other valid collisions. This happens because (by default) it only returns the first 32 collisions it detects. I've had scenarios where all 32 slots are occupied by the same duplicate collision, meaning that other collisions were simply not reported.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Enable Jolt as the 3D physics engine in Project Settings\n2. Place a static rigid body with a concave 3d shape in your scene\n3. Use intersect_shape (the shape can be sphere) to find collisions with the rigid body\n4. intersect_shape will return duplicate collisions\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThis project will run a script to test for collisions when you press enter. It will print the name of all intersected objects, and the number of intersected objects. It shows that 32 collisions with the same object have been found. The scene only contains 1 rigid body:\n\n[intersect-shape-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28389858/intersect-shape-test.zip)\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119868/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119868/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}